{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b684d850ceaec390","name":"Remote Receiver Jammer","source":{"id":"source:reference-b684d850ceaec390","title":"Remote Receiver Jammer","revision":21092,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:09:00Z","sha256":"2e43bed956a18b145a36411b847f6cd63aa979a62a5915fe6e0fc1198a48347b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21092","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Remote%20Receiver%20Jammer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b684d850ceaec390","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The portable Remote Receiver Jammer is developed during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," to scramble Battle Droid ",{"tag":"a","children":["Remote Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Remote_Processor","referenceId":"reference:d46ac6dda5384866"}," links at short range, rendering the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," useless. The Jammer incorporates a backpack transmitter and a handheld computer controller. Remote Receiver Jammers have three significant weaknesses: they have an extremely short range; datalinks are notoriously difficult to disrupt; and many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Backup Processors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Backup_Processors"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Remote Receiver Jammer can be activated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", and the Jammer affects all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Remote Receivers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Remote_Receivers"}," and no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Backup Processors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Backup_Processors"},". When the Jammer is activated, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," using the Jammer makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check. At the start of any affected Droid's turn, compare the results of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check to the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},"; if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check is equal to or higher than the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can take no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," and is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," until the start of its next turn. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," activating the Remote Receiver Jammer must activate it each turn, making a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check each time.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
